   "verbSense": "be, exist (people and animals); with ga, have (people, pets)",
   "englishVerb": "have",
   "trap": "English 'have' leads to kodomo o motte iru or the thing-verb aru; in talk, kids, siblings and partners take iru: kodomo iru?, kyoudai iru? (kodomo o motsu oya, parents with children, is written style).",
   "partners": [
    "kyoudai (brothers and sisters)",
